From 0476b939b1afeab6a50713c462a37b17624751e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kanakku v2 <hello@afraventures.in>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:11:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Kanakku v2: correct books + autopilot

Fixes
- GST no longer counted as income/cost: payments store their GST share; P&L and investor share use amount + TDS - GST
- TDS on customer payments (settles invoice, counted as income, TDS register)
- Book totals computed in the database over all matching entries (were the first 300 rows only)
- Investor capital, GST paid, loans and transfers kept out of P&L (categories.in_pnl)
- Backups added to the LeadOS-VPS compose file; bill photos backed up; optional off-site copy
- Saved integration keys use their own INTEGRATIONS_KEY (no longer tied to JWT_SECRET)

New
- Transfers, opening balances, live account balances
- Credit notes + refunds; purchase bills with GST input credit and brand split
- Month lock (manual + auto-close), enforced on every write incl. Razorpay and recurring
- Bill photos / PDFs on entries and documents
- Bank statement CSV import with auto-matching and learned rules
- GSTR-1 working sheet (B2B/B2CL/B2CS/CDNR/HSN/docs) + GSTR-3B summary; GSTIN check digit
- Autopilot inside the app: recurring entries, reminders, Monday brief, investor statements, month close, alerts, with run log
- Budget vs actual, 30/60/90-day cash forecast
- 2-step login (TOTP), forgot/reset password by email, log out everywhere, investor-only login
- Tests: npm test (pure money logic + full database run)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
